0..81 Comment "//! Well-founded trees branching through a function, after Martin-Löf\'s W-types."
82..157 Comment "//! A node holds a function from a type of branches to its subtrees, so the"
158..229 Comment "//! family occurs to the right of an arrow, never to its left: strictly"
230..310 Comment "//! positive. A fold reaches each subtree by applying that function and recurses"
311..367 Comment "//! on the result, one stage below the node it came from"
368..439 Comment "//! [MartinLof-1982-constructive_mathematics_and_computer_programming]."
440..443 Comment "//!"
444..523 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1982-constructive_mathematics_and_computer_programming]"
524..527 Comment "//!"
